  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Single sheet, accordian folded, with cover in French followed by pages opening to the left; English is printed tête-beche on verso.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Book consists of cover followed by folded pages, each with a successive number from 2-19, and one page of text.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"All literature--past, present and future--can be objectively evaluated at last, thanks to the STANDARD-BOOK which alone ensures the faultless measurement and impartial assessment of printed matter(s)."</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="590" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
