  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="590" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Library's copy accompanied by measuring tape and housed in polished stone trinket box with inlaid floral design on lid; inscribed in blue ink on page with English text: Emmett's copy R.F.</subfield>
